{"id":"dab08a1c5757c6f3","group":"89","path":"89/89-prop-gl-characteristic-frame.md","title":"GL Characteristic Frame Proposition","display":"prop-gl-characteristic-frame — GL Characteristic Frame Proposition","type":"proposition","metadata":{"type":"proposition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-prop-gl-characteristic-frame","aliases":["89-prop-gl-characteristic-frame"],"display":"prop-gl-characteristic-frame — GL Characteristic Frame Proposition","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-frame]]","[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"proposition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-prop-gl-characteristic-frame"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-prop-gl-characteristic-frame</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"prop-gl-characteristic-frame — GL Characteristic Frame Proposition"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c6ab46cd662b1409\" href=\"?note=c6ab46cd662b1409\" title=\"89-df-gl-frame\">89-df-gl-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5c02ba5095698c09\" href=\"?note=5c02ba5095698c09\" title=\"89-df-transitive-frame\">89-df-transitive-frame</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"ae4d761acfb9353d\" href=\"?note=ae4d761acfb9353d\" title=\"89-df-converse-well-founded\">89-df-converse-well-founded</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F=(W,R)\">\\(\\mathcal F=(W,R)\\)</span> is a Kripke frame.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span>, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\)</span>, and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\">\\(\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)\\)</span> are the corresponding frame properties.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gl\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gl\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathrm{GL})\">\\(\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathrm{GL})\\)</span> : GL的特征框架类</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Trans}\">\\(\\mathrm{Trans}\\)</span> : 传递框架</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ConvWF}\">\\(\\mathrm{ConvWF}\\)</span> : 逆良基框架</li>\n<li>GL在传递逆良基框架上完全</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-frame","status":"resolved","id":"c6ab46cd662b1409","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-transitive-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5c02ba5095698c09","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-transitive-frame]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-converse-well-founded","status":"resolved","id":"ae4d761acfb9353d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-converse-well-founded]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal F=(W,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{prop\\text{-}gl\\text{-}characteristic\\text{-}frame}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GLFrame}(\\mathcal F)\n\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{Trans}(\\mathcal F)\\land\\mathrm{CWF}_{W}(R).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Char}(\\mathrm{GL})","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Trans}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ConvWF}","display":false}],"bytes":989,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-45","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-satisfaction-modal]] → [[89-df-converse-well-founded]] → [[89-df-gl-frame]] → [[89-prop-gl-characteristic-frame]] → [[89-prop-converse-wf-transitive]] → [[89-ex-nested-box-edge-extension]]"}],"outgoing":["c6ab46cd662b1409","5c02ba5095698c09","ae4d761acfb9353d"]}